rvices × 1.18; disbursement 8.26% (7% + GST) on all items except supervision (7% × 1.18 would be needed on Quick services, panel slightly higher). Reimbursement (no GST, GST only on disbursement): special flight handling charges 2,888, facilities maintenance 1,122, landing 349, parking 233 (20.7 h; rule unclear, per flight, to be clarified with other invoices), TNLC 103, RNFC 372 (route navigation, Dubai route; by user decision under airport fees, in basket), supervision charges (reimb.) 126 (as 'Airport Supervisory Charges', in disbursement base), PSF 62 and UDF 35 (4 departing pax → 15.50 and 8.75). Catering 2,179 and catering handling 189 not entered. SECOND INVOICE INV-782/2026 (Quick Aviation Services LLC FZ, Dubai, 21 Mar 2026, VAT 0%; A6-AFO E135 24.3 t, OEJN–VABB–IVAN, 07.02 14:32 – 10.02 10:30, approx. 68 h, no pax count): handling 2,750, pax transport 43, CIQ 118, crew transport 2 × 86, slot 59, IGM/EGM 54, supervisor positioning 118, landing 198, parking 356, facilities maintenance 730, special flight handling 9,598, RNFC 317, TNLC 108, PSF 44, UDF 51, catering 1,358, supervision charges 197, catering handling 132, landing permit fee 59, supervision fee 413 (Quick items as amounts incl. GST), disbursement 1,153 = 7% of all items except supervision fee (without GST). USER DECISIONS: OWN group from this invoice (handling 2,750 etc.; water 110.92 from ELL); special flight handling depends on stay (ELL 20.7 h 2,888 ≈ 137.52/h, OWN 68 h 9,598 ≈ 141.15/h) → every started hour 141.15 in all entered groups; parking every started hour ton × 0.25 (ELL 11.28, OWN 6.08; invoices 233 / 356); RNFC 372 (the higher, route-dependent); disbursement 8.26%; PSF per pax 15.50, UDF 17 (safe side, OWN pax count unknown); landing permit fee 59 in basket; catering and catering handling not entered. By user decision fee logic except handling applied to all groups: ALX1·KBI, FLH, ALEX, AFZ handling 'not provided'; Quick services the higher (supervision 413, supervisor positioning 118, water 110.92, CIQ 118, slot 59, IGM/EGM 59, apron transport 279.66, crew transport 101.48, landing permit 59); special flight handling per hour 141.15; parking ton × 0.25 / hour; landing per ton 8.15 (the higher, A6-AFO); facilities maintenance linear between 24.3 t 730 and 45.1 t 1,122 (18.82 per ton), base 730; TNLC 108, RNFC 372, airport supervision 197, PSF 15.50, UDF 17; disbursement 8.26%. UAS invoice UASH26-10153 (17 Aug 2026; T7-KBI CL60, OMDW–VABB–OMDW, 7 Jul 2026, CANCELLED): Quick QAS-0381H/26-27 1,033.82 (GA service charges reimb. 270, facilities maintenance 706, disbursement 5% 49, GST 18% on disbursement 8.82; Aviground 192400002254: Rs 21,250 + 55,625 + GST) + G administration 62.03 (6%) + bank 15 = 1,110.85. USER DECISIONS (5 Nov 2026): UAS separate handler; airport rows same as Quick; Quick's disbursement to UAS 5.9% (5% + GST) on reimbursement items; G administration 6%; bank 15 tick; cancellation GA service charge 270 not entered; handling and Quick services with second invoice. UAS invoice (T7-KBI, 7–8 Jul 2026): airport slot arrangement 25, revision 12.50 (date change), bank 15 = 52.50. USER DECISIONS: UAS slot 25 in Slot Charges row, basket; slot revision 12.50 tick. QUICK price list (E35L 24 t, 22 Nov 2026, USD): handling 3,100 per arrival/departure (entered as in document, excl. GST, user decision); GA / special flight handling = premium service package + GA charge, for this flight premium package + handling 3,100 (user); premium package 4–12 h 1,297, 12–24 h 1,946, above 24 h per day or part 1,946 (E35L Special Flight Handling row, replaces 141.15 per hour); landing 188, parking first 2 h free then 4.21 per hour, TNLC 107, RNFC as per actual (372 kept), FMC 722, supervision (supersoft) 195, PSF 15, UDF 9 per embarking and 4 per disembarking pax (E35L only; other groups unchanged). Quick services incl. GST 18% (all groups): IGM/EGM 59, toilet / water 114.46 per service; tick: GPU 112.10 per hour, pushback 172.28, towing 160.48, security 590 and baggage X-ray 348.10 if required. Not entered: catering handling 130, unauthorised overstay 59 per hour, crew transport / supervisor positioning / crew hotel / catering as per actual. Disbursement 7% on third-party charges and GST 18% on total invoice (panel 8.26% unchanged). Cancellation (VABB, BOM-based aircraft): 6–12 h before 50% of GA charges, 6 h 50% of GA and FMC, 3 h 100% of GA and FMC; 12 h or more no charge. AEROELITE AVIATION SERVICES quotation QT-2627155 (22 Nov 2026, E35L 24,300 kg, bill to Falcon Flight Support), entered as in document without GST (user): ground handling 2,750, flight supervision 175, slot coordination 50, CIQ/EGM/IGM coordination 80, landing 161, parking 9.65 per hour, GA charges 326 per arrival and departure separately (>24 h up to 48 h +35%, beyond 48 h fresh), pax charges 26 disembarking / 19.60 embarking, facility maintenance 605, airport operator coordination 164 (Airport Supervisory row, user), navigation 490 approx. (RNFC row), towbar 125 (Pushback, tick), water 95, toilet 95, ramp bus 134 per trip (Apron Transport), ramp vehicle 55 per trip (Crew Transport, tick), VIP cars 134 if required (tick), premium service 1,630 per day (Special Flight Handling row, each started 24 h); catering coordination 109 not entered. GST 18% on total invoice (not in panel); disbursement 4% on third-party invoice amount (airport fees). USER DECISION 23 Nov 2026: GST not in panel for any VABB handler; Quick services converted to excl. GST (÷ 1.18: supervision 350, supervisor positioning 100, CIQ 100, slot 50, IGM/EGM 50, landing permit 50, water / toilet 97, apron transport 237 (E35L 36.44), crew transport 86, GLEX handling 2,824, GPU 95, pushback 146, towing 136, security 500, X-ray 295) and Quick disbursement 7% (previously 8.26% incl. GST). Earlier verified comparisons (QAS-0153H/0154H, INV-782) were made incl. GST.","services":[{"airport":false,"disb":false,"name":"Handling Fee","qty":true,"qtyDef":1,"unit":"flight"},{"airport":false,"dis